@dotnet_crud_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Get all todo items
GET {{dotnet_crud_HostAddress}}/api/todoitem
Accept: application/json

### Create a new todo item
POST {{dotnet_crud_HostAddress}}/api/todoitem
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test my new dotnet api",
  "isCompleted": false
}
